{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "label": "Wann sich die Zeremonie auszahlt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Geteilter State ueber gleichzeitige Requests, Crash-Recovery, Verteilung ueber Nodes, bruechige Fehlerbehandlung. Bleib bei Vanilla TS bei ueberwiegend zustandsloser Request/Response-Arbeit in einem Prozess."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_shared_mutable_state_race", "label": "Geteilter mutabler State mit gleichzeitigen Schreibern", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jedes await gibt den Loop frei, ein has-Check kann also von einem zweiten Aufruf passiert werden. Der Actor verarbeitet Commands einer nach dem anderen \u2014 keine Locks, keine In-Flight-Sets, keine Race."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_eventemitter_to_typed_actor", "label": "EventEmitter + Handler -> typisierte Actor-Events", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "EventEmitter erzwingt weder Event-Name noch Arg-Form und hat keine Supervision. Listener-Actors sind First-Class, und die Supervisor-Strategie ist die zentrale Fehlerbehandlungsstelle statt Listener-On-Error-Gymnastik."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_background_loop_to_timers", "label": "Hintergrund-Loop -> context.timers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "setInterval plus mutabler State laesst Reads mitten in ein Update fallen und laeuft ohne Supervision weiter. Im Actor sind tick und get-status serialisiert, der Timer canceled sich beim Stop und ein frisches preStart armiert ihn neu."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_event_sourced_saga", "label": "Event-Sourced Saga statt verschachtelter try/catch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jeder Schritt wird persistiert, bevor der naechste folgt, sodass ein Crash mitten in der Saga durch Replay fortsetzt \u2014 auch der Kompensations-State. Lohnt sich bei Sekunden bis Minuten Laufzeit und kritischen Kompensationen; fuer sub-Sekunden-Sagas ist die try/catch-Kette in Ordnung."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_async_stack_trace_loss", "label": "Async-Stack-Traces verlieren den Aufrufer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Trace eines Actors zeigt nur den Dispatch, nicht das tell im HTTP-Handler. Milderung ist LogContext MDC mit einer propagierten requestId, damit Logs ueber Actors hinweg zusammenpassen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_synchronous_read_cost", "label": "Synchrone Reads kosten einen Roundtrip", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "State von aussen zu lesen braucht ein ask. Fuer High-Volume-Reads projiziert man in einen Read-Side-View oder denormalisiert, sodass ein Ask alles liefert."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_library_code_expects_promises", "label": "Library-Code erwartet Promise-APIs", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ORMs, SDKs und Validierungs-Libraries sind Promise-basiert; sie in Actors zu wrappen fuegt eine Schicht hinzu. Actors sind am wertvollsten fuer den zustandsbehafteten Kern der Domaene, nicht fuer Boundary-Code."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_staged_adoption_strategy", "label": "Gestaffelte Adoptions-Strategie", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zustandsbehaftetes Konzept zuerst, dann zeitgesteuerte Arbeit, dann Cross-Process-Verteilung, dann Event Sourcing. Jeder Schritt ist eigenstaendig wertvoll \u2014 man kann bei jedem aufhoeren."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_shared_mutable_state_race", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_eventemitter_to_typed_actor", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_background_loop_to_timers", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_event_sourced_saga", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_async_stack_trace_loss", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_synchronous_read_cost", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_library_code_expects_promises", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_staged_adoption_strategy", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_when_to_reach_for_actors", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_shared_mutable_state_race", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_event_sourced_saga", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_event_sourced_saga", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_orleans_no_cross_grain_transactions", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_vanilla_ts_background_loop_to_timers", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_migration_from_orleans_reminders_have_no_equivalent", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/migration/from-vanilla-ts.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}